" class="light flex w-full flex-col gap-3 rounded-[var(--radius)] bg-background text-ink px-5 py-3.5 shadow-[0_20px_48px_0_rgba(0,13,31,0.34)] md:w-[480px] md:shrink-0 md:gap-5 md:px-[34px] md:pb-[30px] md:pt-8"><p class="font-display text-[22px] font-bold text-ink md:text-[30px]">Obtenez votre prix fixe</p><label class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1.5 md:gap-2"><span class="text-[12.5px] font-medium tracking-[0.06em] text-ink-mid">QUEL EST LE PROBLÈME ?</span><select class="h-auto rounded-[var(--control-radius)] bg-card px-4 py-2.5 text-[16px] md:py-[15px] md:text-[16px] shadow-none" name="job" required=true><option value="blocked_drain">Canalisation bouchée</option><option value="burst_pipe">Tuyau éclaté ou qui fuit</option><option value="hot_water">Eau chaude</option><option value="tap_toilet">Robinet, WC ou chasse d’eau</option><option value="sewer_line">Conduite d’égout</option><option value="leak_detection">Détection de fuite</option><option value="repipe">Retubage complet de la maison</option><option value="fit_out">Aménagement salle de bains ou cuisine</option><option value="other">Autre chose</option></select></label><label class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1.5 md:gap-2"><span class="text-[12.5px] font-medium tracking-[0.06em] text-ink-mid">OÙ ÊTES-VOUS ?</span><input type="text" class="file:text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft selection:bg-primary selection:text-on-primary border-input w-full min-w-0 border transition-[color,box-shadow] outline-none file:inline-flex file:h-7 file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-accent-error/20 aria-invalid:border-accent-error h-auto rounded-[var(--control-radius)] bg-card px-4 py-2.5 text-[16px] md:py-[15px] md:text-[16px] shadow-none" data-slot="input" name="zip" required=true placeholder="Quartier ou code postal" value=""/></label><label class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1.5 md:gap-2"><span class="text-[12.5px] font-medium tracking-[0.06em] text-ink-mid">MOBILE</span><input type="tel" class="file:text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft selection:bg-primary selection:text-on-primary border-input w-full min-w-0 border transition-[color,box-shadow] outline-none file:inline-flex file:h-7 file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-accent-error/20 aria-invalid:border-accent-error h-auto rounded-[var(--control-radius)] bg-card px-4 py-2.5 text-[16px] md:py-[15px] md:text-[16px] shadow-none" data-slot="input" name="mobile" required=true placeholder="(503) 000-0000" value=""/></label><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-[var(--control-radius)] transition-all cursor-pointer disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&#38;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&#38;_svg:not([class*=&#39;size-&#39;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&#38;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-accent-error/20 aria-invalid:border-accent-error bg-primary text-on-primary hover:bg-primary/90 px-[var(--control-px)] py-[var(--control-py)] text-[length:var(--control-text)] w-full [font-weight:600]" data-slot="button" type="submit">Envoyez-moi mon prix  →</button><p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.52] text-ink-soft">Nous vous envoyons votre fourchette de prix par SMS sous 10 minutes, de 7h à 21h. Urgence immédiate ? Appelez le (503) 555-0148 — nous décrochons 24h/24.</p><div class="h-px w-full bg-border"></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="font-semibold text-positive" data-slot="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span class="text-[13px] font-medium text-ink-mid">Votre numéro sert à envoyer le devis. Rien d’autre, jamais.</span></div></form></div></section>
